<div class="tour-detail-hero" style="background-image: url('/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg');">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>11 Days China to Kyrgyzstan Overland: Urumqi to Bishkek</h1>
    <div class="route">📍 Urumqi → Kashgar → Torugart Pass → Tash Rabat → Kochkor → Issyk Kul → Bishkek</div>
